		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>This swarm of rats has entwined, intergrown tails and moves as a clump. It has sentience and telepathy.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 28, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 bite +0 (1 + disease) or psychic burble, <strong>MV</strong> close (climb), <strong>S</strong> -3, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Disease</strong>. CON 9+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON.</p><p></p><p><strong>Psychic Burble</strong>. The swarm unleashes a cacophonous, gnawing psychic wave. Sentient enemies in double near CHA 12+ or stunned for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
